                                                "sense_id": "af5e4224-2cdd-3887-aaf8-38adea9bd3fb",
                                                "text": "In strange contrast to the hardly tolerable constraint and nameless invisible domineerings of the captain's table, was the entire care-free license and ease, the almost frantic democracy of those inferior fellows the harpooneers."
